+## Quick Start
+
+```python
+from aspose_pdf import Document
+
+with Document() as document:
+    page = document.pages.add()
+    page.add_text(
+        "Hello from Aspose.PDF FOSS for Python!",
+        x=72,
+        y=720,
+        font_size=18,
+    )
+    document.save("hello.pdf")
 ```
 
